# Implementation Plan - Expand Delegation Page Access

The goal is to allow all Approver roles (Operations Manager, General Manager, CTO, HOD Projects) to access and manage delegations, while also ensuring the Administrator role is not accidentally excluded.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend

#### [MODIFY] [delegation.routes.ts](file:///c:/Apps/Leave%20Tracker/server/src/routes/delegation.routes.ts)
- Update the `authorize` middleware to include `OPERATIONS_MANAGER`, `GENERAL_MANAGER`, `CTO`, and `HOD_PROJECTS` in addition to `ADMINISTRATOR`.

### Frontend

#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///c:/Apps/Leave%20Tracker/src/App.tsx)
- Add `ADMINISTRATOR` to the `allowedRoles` for the `/delegation` route.

#### [MODIFY] [Sidebar.tsx](file:///c:/Apps/Leave%20Tracker/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx)
- Add `ADMINISTRATOR` to the `allowedRoles` for the "Delegation" navigation item.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- None available for this specific change, but manual verification will be thorough.

### Manual Verification
- Log in as **Operations Manager** and verify the Delegation page displays the list of approvers and allows toggling status.
- Log in as **Administrator** and verify the Delegation page is still accessible and functional.
- Log in as a regular **Employee** and verify the Delegation page is NOT accessible.
